1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,570
Why do you and your best friend

2
00:00:01,571 --> 00:00:03,570
get each other with just one look?

3
00:00:03,571 --> 00:00:04,540
A crowded table.

4
00:00:04,541 --> 00:00:06,270
Someone says something ridiculous...

5
00:00:06,271 --> 00:00:07,163
And the two of you

6
00:00:07,164 --> 00:00:09,010
lock eyes at the exact same moment.

7
00:00:09,011 --> 00:00:09,990
Not a single word.

8
00:00:09,991 --> 00:00:11,180
But in that one second,

9
00:00:11,181 --> 00:00:12,940
everything got said.

10
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,520
This isn't telepathy.

11
00:00:14,521 --> 00:00:15,171
Close friends' brains

12
00:00:15,172 --> 00:00:16,040
react to the world

13
00:00:16,041 --> 00:00:18,760
in surprisingly similar ways.

14
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,410
You've laughed at the same things,

15
00:00:20,411 --> 00:00:22,270
gotten annoyed by the same people,

16
00:00:22,271 --> 00:00:24,040
built a shared archive.

17
00:00:24,041 --> 00:00:24,899
So the tiniest lift

18
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,310
of their eyebrow...

19
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,280
opens in your head

20
00:00:27,281 --> 00:00:28,830
like a giant ZIP file.

21
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:31,640
So that look is no coincidence.

22
00:00:31,641 --> 00:00:33,223
That's the person who sees

23
00:00:33,224 --> 00:00:35,350
the world through your eyes.
